{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Trial Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version is a slice of the opening segment of the full game, offering approximately 15-20 minutes of gameplay. You will experience infiltrating a mansion as a thief, followed by theft, puzzle-solving, various encounters with Jenny, and chase sequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pay for a loved one's medical bills, you became a thief, living a life of theft. Your partner told you about a potentially valuable treasure in a haunted mansion out in the wilderness, rekindling your hope... But upon entering the mansion, you find it has been taken over by a creepy little girl in red. On her turf, you'd better obey her and play along with her games... or else...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get in, make a grand, get out. That's the plan.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.poster.avif?t=1761582351\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.webm?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/9c10cf07b50baba6181aa3de0c041823.mp4?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a professional thief, loot everything of value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your wits to solve the puzzle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/2488d4ee12e4c08dbb8b8f3d17f7ad9c.poster.avif?t=1761582351\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/2488d4ee12e4c08dbb8b8f3d17f7ad9c.webm?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/2488d4ee12e4c08dbb8b8f3d17f7ad9c.mp4?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All kinds of eerie events and chases await...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.poster.avif?t=1761582351\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.webm?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/extras/976e14970274345f8bcf3a4caf4b23e4.mp4?t=1761582351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118580?t=1761582351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118580?t=1761582351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/7d5659bd832b5df8c125e84300bdff3463eb23ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761582351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118580/7d5659bd832b5df8c125e84300bdff3463eb23ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761582351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains jump scares and horror elements. Players are advised to assess their tolerance before playing."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Trial Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version is a slice of the opening segment of t